{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1963. The bombs fell. The ice caps melted. The Bots won.</strong> Humanity\u2019s last stand isn't on the surface\u2014it\u2019s in the crushing depths below the sea. You are <strong>Cade Callahan</strong>, a fresh recruit for the Rusted Retaliators. Your mission: complete the R.U.S.T.E.D. protocol and turn the tide of the war against the mechanical SeaBot legion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SURVIVAL LOOP</strong> Rusted Sea combines underwater exploration with a satisfying extraction economy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed The Replicator:</strong> You are a scavenger at heart. Collect scrap metal and debris floating in the wreckage of the old world. Feed it into your <strong>Replicator </strong>to instantly print ammunition, batteries, and essential survival consumables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pressure Point Economy:</strong> The Retaliators don't work for free. Locate volatile <strong>Nukelium</strong> deposits and extract them. Send the payload back to command to earn <strong>Pressure Points</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Oceanic Industries Armory:</strong> Spend your hard-earned Pressure Points at the SHELL.E Terminal. Unlock guns,s gear, and vehicles that you can\u2019t craft in the field.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARSENAL &amp; VEHICLES</strong> You won't be swimming alone.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot the Deep:</strong> Tired of swimming? Purchase and deploy a variety of underwater vehicles, from the agile Rusted Riptide<strong>\u00a0</strong>to the sidekick SCWID.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools of the Trade:</strong> Wield a vast array of 1960s gadgets. Use your <strong>Welder</strong> for repairs, the <strong>Drill\u00a0</strong>for mining, and high-caliber <strong>Torpedo Gun\u00a0</strong>for when the SeaBots get too close.<br><br><br>The SeaBots are evolving. They are learning. Load your weapon, check your oxygen, and get to work, Callahan.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2722780?t=1772632874","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772632874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/043778ee3ce9f3303f90203fad9bb6b1106e670c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772632874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/043778ee3ce9f3303f90203fad9bb6b1106e670c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772632874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1963. The bombs fell. The ice caps melted. The Bots won.</strong> Humanity\u2019s last stand isn't on the surface\u2014it\u2019s in the crushing depths below the sea. You are <strong>Cade Callahan</strong>, a fresh recruit for the Rusted Retaliators. Your mission: complete the R.U.S.T.E.D. protocol and turn the tide of the war against the mechanical SeaBot legion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SURVIVAL LOOP</strong> Rusted Sea combines underwater exploration with a satisfying extraction economy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed The Replicator:</strong> You are a scavenger at heart. Collect scrap metal and debris floating in the wreckage of the old world. Feed it into your <strong>Replicator </strong>to instantly print ammunition, batteries, and essential survival consumables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pressure Point Economy:</strong> The Retaliators don't work for free. Locate volatile <strong>Nukelium</strong> deposits and extract them. Send the payload back to command to earn <strong>Pressure Points</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Oceanic Industries Armory:</strong> Spend your hard-earned Pressure Points at the SHELL.E Terminal. Unlock guns,s gear, and vehicles that you can\u2019t craft in the field.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARSENAL &amp; VEHICLES</strong> You won't be swimming alone.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot the Deep:</strong> Tired of swimming? Purchase and deploy a variety of underwater vehicles, from the agile Rusted Riptide<strong>\u00a0</strong>to the sidekick SCWID.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools of the Trade:</strong> Wield a vast array of 1960s gadgets. Use your <strong>Welder</strong> for repairs, the <strong>Drill\u00a0</strong>for mining, and high-caliber <strong>Torpedo Gun\u00a0</strong>for when the SeaBots get too close.<br><br><br>The SeaBots are evolving. They are learning. Load your weapon, check your oxygen, and get to work, Callahan.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Meerkatapult Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/1c97ba6797c88e1a325547d3a022183d8f57e2a5/header.jpg?t=1772632874","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2722780/1079302122/b5be1065cf77ca1220aedb3a1fe603d4f57957bf/1769180347/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769191298","dash_